Read the whole guidebook and its worked assessment/action material. Relate service performance to staff, operations, infrastructure, financial capacity and relationships with users. Use the worksheets as aids to explanation and revision rather than prerequisites for creating learning Records.

The cover, contents and introductory method were inspected on 30 October 2026. The document's running title also uses Sustainable Utility Management; retain the cited cover and edition when locating it. Public reading is available, with attribution and component notices preserved. Institutional and financial examples require translation into the actual setting.

